msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? ¿Kitamura?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, are you by yourself?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, ¿estás solo?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah, by myself. Perfect timing. Care＿to take a breather with me over there?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí, solo. Qué buen momento. ¿Quieres＿tomar un respiro allá conmigo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Okay, I don't mind......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E-Está bien, no tengo problema......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Where's Taiga......? Doesn't seem like＿she's hiding anywhere......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Dónde está Taiga......? No parece＿estar escondida por ningún lado......）」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hm? What's the matter? Are you＿looking for...... *Gasp* THIS!?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Mmm? ¿Qué pasa? ¿Acaso estás＿buscando...... ¡Ah! ¡¿ESTO?!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, sorry. If it had been hanging out,＿that would have been quite the＿horrible blunder.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, perdón. Si hubiera quedado a la＿vista, habría sido un descuido terrible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......If my returning memory serves,＿you've done so much worse that it'd be＿a drop in the bucket for you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Si mis recuerdos no me fallan,＿has hecho cosas mucho peores y esto＿no sería nada para ti.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Mm, your memory serves you well.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mm, tus recuerdos no te fallan.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't think that's something to be＿proud of......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No creo que eso sea motivo＿de orgullo......」"

msgid "Kitamura「I was finally able to bring you here,＿Takasu. At last, I've fulfilled that＿promise.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por fin pude traerte aquí, Takasu.＿Al fin cumplí esa promesa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Promise?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Promesa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, I agree it's not girly, but...... what＿does this sports magazine have to do＿with anything?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, concuerdo en que no es femenina,＿pero...... ¿qué tiene que ver esta＿revista deportiva con todo esto?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Don't you recall the time when I tried＿to go home without taking part in the＿student council presidential election?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿No recuerdas cuando intenté irme a casa＿sin participar en la elección＿presidencial del consejo estudiantil?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, Big Bro!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡Ah, Hermano Mayor!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Uh, yeah, her.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Eh, sí, ella.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hm?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mmm?」"

msgid "Kitamura「It was the Prez...... I mean, the former＿president.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Era la Presidenta......＿Digo, la expresidenta.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「She came at a good time. It was right＿before the deadline to register for＿candidacy, as I recall.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Llegó en buen momento. Fue justo＿antes del límite para inscribir＿candidaturas, según recuerdo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah, seriously. I barely made it.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí, en serio. Llegué por los pelos.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Oh yeah...... No, wait, that's not the＿worst of it...... Oh yeah, Big Bro's brawl＿with Taiga!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-Ah, sí...... No, espera, eso no＿es lo peor...... ¡Ah, sí, la pelea＿de Hermano Mayor con Taiga!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Haha, that battle has already become a＿legend.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Jaja, esa batalla ya se＿ha vuelto una leyenda.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「That's right, Taiga got suspended for＿it...... And now Big Bro is in America.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es cierto, suspendieron a Taiga＿por eso...... Y ahora Hermano Mayor＿está en Estados Unidos.」"

msgid "Kitamura「She's adjusting to college, apparently.＿Looks like you've been able to＿remember quite a bit, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Al parecer se está adaptando a la＿universidad. Se nota que ya pudiste＿recordar bastante, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't really get it, but for some＿reason I was able to remember a few＿things pretty smoothly.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No lo entiendo bien, pero por alguna＿razón pude recordar algunas cosas＿con bastante fluidez.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Glad to hear it. I hope you manage to＿remember everything before school＿starts.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Me alegra oírlo. Espero que logres＿recordarlo todo antes de que＿empiecen las clases.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Likewise, I...... uh, never mind.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Igualmente, yo...... eh, olvídalo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「What? It's weird for you to hesitate.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué? Es raro que dudes así.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, it's just......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, es solo que......」"

msgid "Nothing, really"
msgstr "Nada, en serio"

msgid "Have you gotten over your heartbreak?"
msgstr "¿Ya superaste tu desamor?"

msgid "Have you and Taiga started dating?"
msgstr "¿Taiga y tú empezaron a salir?"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Kitamura「......?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No...... It's nothing, really.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No...... No es nada, en serio.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I appreciate that, but...... Kitamura, do＿you really need that much sugar in＿your coffee?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Te lo agradezco, pero...... Kitamura,＿¿de verdad necesitas tanta azúcar＿en tu café?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oh!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's more like coffee in your sugar at＿this point.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A estas alturas ya es más＿bien café en tu azúcar.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Let me have a taste...... Pfff!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Déjame probar...... ¡Pfff!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Gah, what are you doing!? Who are you,＿Taiga? Good lord.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Gah, qué haces?! ¿Quién＿eres, Taiga? Por Dios.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「MOTTAINAI!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡QUÉ DESPERDICIO!」"

msgid "Kitamura「Ohh, I'm glad to hear you say that.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ohh, me alegra oírte decir eso.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Laugh it up, chuckles. You made your＿bed, and now you're drinking it.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ríete todo lo que quieras. Cosechas lo＿que siembras, y ahora te lo bebes.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Of course I am. I have no choice but to＿order another one and try to even it＿out a little. Be right back.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Por supuesto. No me queda más que＿pedir otro e intentar equilibrarlo＿un poco. Ahora vuelvo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Kitamura...... It's probably better not to＿touch on the subject of Big Bro too＿much......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Kitamura...... Quizá sea mejor＿no tocar demasiado el tema de＿Hermano Mayor......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's just...... Have you gotten over your＿heartbreak yet?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Es solo que...... ¿Ya superaste＿tu desamor?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oho, Takasu, that's quite direct of you.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Oho, Takasu, qué directo eres.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, sorry.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, perdón.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you say, but......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eso dices, pero......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（So you say, but...... I watched it tear you＿apart, Kitamura......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Eso dices, pero...... Yo vi cómo＿te destrozaba, Kitamura......）」"

msgid "Kitamura「......What's wrong?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¿Qué pasa?」"

msgid "Kitamura「There's no need to hold anything back＿from me. I would happily reopen old＿wounds for your sake. Hahaha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No hace falta que te guardes nada＿conmigo. Con gusto reabriría viejas＿heridas por ti. ¡Jajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But before that, Kitamura, isn't that a＿little too much hot sauce? Your＿cheese toast is completely red.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero antes de eso, Kitamura, ¿no es＿demasiada salsa picante? Tu pan con＿queso está completamente rojo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oh!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You weren't paying attention, were＿you?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No estabas prestando atención, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......HNNGGHH!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¡HNNGGHH!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What the hell are you doing? Are you＿alright?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué diablos haces? ¿Estás bien?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Don't be ridiculous!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡No seas ridículo!」"

msgid "Kitamura「HOOOO! HEEEEE!!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡HOOOO! ¡¡HEEEEE!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I told you so! Here, drink some cold＿water!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Te lo dije! ¡Toma, bebe＿un poco de agua fría!」"

msgid "Kitamura「............Whew, Mt. Fuji erupted halfway＿down. Hahaha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「............Uf, el monte Fuji entró en＿erupción a mitad de camino. ¡Jajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kitamura, are you really okay......?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Kitamura, ¿de verdad estás bien......?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Obviously! Hahahaha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Obviamente! ¡Jajajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（He's acting like he doesn't care, but I'll＿bet he hasn't really gotten over it......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Actúa como si no le importara, pero＿apuesto a que no lo ha superado......）」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hahahaha...... *cough* *cough*」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Jajajaja...... *cof, cof*」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Have you and Taiga started dating?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Taiga y tú empezaron a salir?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......By Taiga, are you referring to＿Aisaka?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......¿Por Taiga te refieres a Aisaka?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「You don't run into girls named Taiga＿every day.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No te topas con chicas llamadas＿Taiga todos los días.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Hm......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Mm......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Kitamura?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Kitamura?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, sorry. I got a little lost in thought,＿wondering what could have led to such＿a misunderstanding.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Ah, perdón. Me perdí un poco en mis＿pensamientos, preguntándome qué pudo＿haber causado tal malentendido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Misunderstanding?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Malentendido?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah. Misunderstanding,＿misconception, something along those＿lines.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí. Malentendido, idea equivocada,＿algo por el estilo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But weren't you two hanging out＿earlier today?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero no andaban juntos＿hoy más temprano?」"

msgid "Kitamura「What? You saw us?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¿Qué? ¿Nos viste?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, other people told me......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, me lo contó otra gente......」"

msgid "Kitamura「I won't deny we were hanging out, but＿it wasn't a date or anything.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「No niego que hayamos pasado el rato,＿pero no era una cita ni nada parecido.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But you hadn't brought it up this＿whole time.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero no habías mencionado nada＿en todo este tiempo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「No, you don't have to apologize...... It's＿just, I thought you were hiding it, so I＿got suspicious.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No, no tienes que disculparte......＿Es solo que creí que lo ocultabas＿y por eso sospeché.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yeah...... Thinking about it from your＿perspective, that's only natural.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí...... Pensándolo desde tu punto＿de vista, es lo más natural.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uhh, well, it's just...... you know......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, bueno, es que...... ya sabes......」"

msgid "Kitamura「You see, Takasu, Aisaka wants you to＿acknowledge her.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Verás, Takasu, Aisaka quiere＿que la reconozcas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Uh, what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Eh, ¿qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So, acknowledge what?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces, ¿reconocer qué?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Good question. Truth is, I didn't ask for＿the specifics......」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Buena pregunta. La verdad, no＿pregunté los detalles......」"

msgid "Kitamura「In short, Aisaka wants to be your＿equal, Takasu.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「En resumen, Aisaka quiere＿ser tu igual, Takasu.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Equal......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Mi igual......」"

msgid "Kitamura「That's my guess, but only Aisaka＿knows whether it's accurate.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Es lo que supongo, pero solo＿Aisaka sabe si es cierto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Kitamura「Oh, I know! You should probably take＿this with you.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「¡Ah, ya sé! Deberías llevarte＿esto contigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It looks like a receipt from the station＿square grocery store.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Parece un recibo del supermercado＿de la plaza de la estación.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Yep, right on the money. She asked me＿of all people to help with the shopping＿and I obliged.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Sí, diste en el clavo. Me pidió＿justo a mí que la ayudara con＿las compras y acepté.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Someone like you could tell just from＿that whether the shopping went well,＿right?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Alguien como tú sabría solo＿con ver eso si las compras＿salieron bien, ¿verdad?」"

msgid "Kitamura「Truly she isn't. But please, give that＿advice to her directly.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「En verdad no lo es. Pero por favor, dale＿ese consejo a ella directamente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, that's a good idea.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, es buena idea.」"

msgid "Kitamura「So, as for your original question of＿\"Have you and Taiga started dating?\"＿the answer is \"No.\"」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Así que, sobre tu pregunta original＿de \"¿Taiga y tú empezaron a salir?\",＿la respuesta es \"No\".」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Oh, that's right. I just remembered.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Ah, cierto. Acabo de recordarlo.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Thinking back, I've just been＿constantly rejected, huh? Hahaha.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Pensándolo bien, solo me han rechazado＿una y otra vez, ¿eh? Jajaja.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「So you've progressed to the point＿where you can laugh it off, huh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Así que ya avanzaste al punto en＿que puedes reírte de ello, eh.」"

msgid "Kitamura「If I still had anything left in this heart＿of mine, I'd want you to comb through,＿find it and lay it bare for me. Hahaha!」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Si aún quedara algo en este corazón＿mío, querría que rebuscaras hasta＿sacarlo a la luz. ¡Jajaja!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「If only that were the case, Kitamura.＿But first, what are you pretending to＿drink out of that empty glass?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ojalá fuera así, Kitamura. Pero＿antes, ¿qué finges estar bebiendo＿de ese vaso vacío?」"

msgid "Kitamura「......Oho, when did this happen? This＿won't do. I'll go ask for a refill. You＿want one too?」"
msgstr "Kitamura「......Oho, ¿cuándo pasó esto? Así＿no se puede. Iré a pedir otro.＿¿Quieres uno tú también?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, yes please.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, sí, por favor.」"

msgid "Kitamura「Alright. One moment, please.」"
msgstr "Kitamura「Muy bien. Un momento, por favor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（You're trying way too hard,＿Kitamura......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Te estás esforzando demasiado,＿Kitamura......）」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, where have you been?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ryuuji, ¿dónde habías estado?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What the? Don't tell me -- have you＿been waiting here for me the whole＿time?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pero qué? No me digas-- ¿has estado＿esperándome aquí todo este tiempo?」"

msgid "Taiga「I never would have guessed that no＿one was home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Nunca habría imaginado que＿no había nadie en casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Then you could have called me. It's＿cold out, and you're carrying all that＿stuff.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Entonces pudiste haberme llamado.＿Hace frío afuera y cargas con＿todas esas cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, gimme a sec.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, dame un segundo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Water's boiling. What do you want?＿Black tea? Green tea, maybe?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「El agua ya hierve. ¿Qué quieres? ¿Té＿negro? ¿O té verde, tal vez?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（She's not listening. She's been like that＿ever since we set foot in here......＿What's going on?）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（No está escuchando. Ha estado＿así desde que pusimos un pie aquí......＿¿Qué está pasando?）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Green tea it is. I found some＿great-looking tea leaves.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Entonces té verde. Encontré unas＿hojas de té con muy buena pinta.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Hey, Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Oye, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......It's no use.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......No sirve de nada.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Here you go. It's hot.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Aquí tienes. Está caliente.」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's the matter with you? Oh, are＿you hungry? I'll throw something＿together, if you like.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué te pasa? Ah, ¿tienes hambre? Te＿preparo algo rápido, si quieres.」"

msgid "Taiga「Ugh, be quiet. I'm just thinking about＿stuff...... Or I was. Oh well. Here, take＿this.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Agh, cállate. Solo estaba pensando＿en cosas...... O eso hacía.＿En fin. Toma esto.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Whoa, that's a huge paper bag. Did you＿go shopping or something?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Uau, qué bolsa de papel tan enorme.＿¿Fuiste de compras o algo así?」"

msgid "Taiga「No, I didn't. This is yours.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No, no fui. Esto es tuyo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Mine?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mío?」"

msgid "Taiga「Yeah. It's exchanged hands a few＿times, but it's time it was returned to＿you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Sí. Ha pasado por varias manos, pero＿ya era hora de que volviera a ti.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh man, this suit looks crazy＿expensive. Is it really mine?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Vaya, este traje se ve carísimo.＿¿De verdad es mío?」"

msgid "Taiga「......Yeah.」"
msgstr "Taiga「......Sí.」"

msgid "Taiga「That's right...... Oh, that's right!」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es verdad...... ¡Ah, es verdad!」"

msgid "Taiga「Why is that box with this suit!?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¿Por qué está esa caja con este traje?!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「O-Ohh!? I...... don't know?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿E-Ehh?! ¿Yo...... no lo sé?」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji, this is kinda important here!＿Can't you remember anything?」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Ryuuji, esto es bastante importante!＿¿No logras recordar nada?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「E-Easy for you to say...... Hmmm......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Q-Qué fácil es decirlo...... Mmmm......」"

msgid "Taiga「Well, whatever. Knowing you, I'm sure＿you probably forgot it was in your＿pocket, you stupid idiot! Why did you......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Bueno, como sea. Conociéndote, ¡seguro＿olvidaste que estaba en tu bolsillo,＿tonto idiota! ¿Por qué tú......」"

msgid "Taiga「Oh, I see...... So you were in such a rush＿that you......」"
msgstr "Taiga「Ah, ya veo...... Así que tenías＿tanta prisa que tú......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué?」"

msgid "Taiga「Nothing!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Nada!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......W-Well anyway, this should help me＿remember, right? Thanks for going out＿of your way to get it back for me.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......B-Bueno, como sea, esto debería＿ayudarme a recordar, ¿no? Gracias por＿tomarte la molestia de recuperarlo.」"

msgid "Taiga「No problem. More importantly, Ryuuji,＿listen to what I'm about to say as＿closely and carefully as you can.」"
msgstr "Taiga「De nada. Más importante aún, Ryuuji,＿escucha lo que te voy a decir con＿toda la atención posible.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Taiga「You're going to put on that suit, take＿that present and go see Minorin.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Te vas a poner ese traje, tomarás ese＿regalo e irás a ver a Minorin.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Kushieda?」"

msgid "Taiga「It's shock therapy. Didn't I tell you＿yesterday?」"
msgstr "Taiga「Es terapia de choque.＿¿No te lo dije ayer?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......This is what I was supposed to＿prepare for?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Para esto se suponía＿que debía prepararme?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I don't understand what you mean.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「No entiendo qué quieres decir.」"

msgid "Taiga「You don't have to understand right＿now. But this is sure to make you＿remember all kinds of stuff.」"
msgstr "Taiga「No tienes que entenderlo ahora mismo.＿Pero seguro esto te hará recordar＿toda clase de cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......」"

msgid "Taiga「Listen, Ryuuji...... If you're the man I＿think you are -- and I trust that you are＿-- I think this will be painful for you.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Escucha, Ryuuji...... Si eres el hombre＿que creo --y confío en que lo eres--,＿creo que esto te va a doler.」"

msgid "Taiga「But for the sake of getting back all of＿your memories, it's inevitable.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Pero para poder recuperar todos＿tus recuerdos, es inevitable.」"

msgid "Taiga「Anyway, just go. Go on and give that to＿Minorin. When you do, I'm sure you'll＿remember all kinds of stuff.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Como sea, solo ve. Ve y dale eso a＿Minorin. Cuando lo hagas, seguro que＿recordarás un montón de cosas.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Hey Taiga, I feel kinda uneasy about＿this...... Besides, \"go\" where? Have you＿even talked to Kushieda?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Oye, Taiga, esto me da algo de mala＿espina...... Además, ¿\"ir\" adónde? ¿Ya＿hablaste siquiera con Kushieda?」"

msgid "Taiga「Quit your bitching! Now go and get＿changed already, you useless mutt. I'll＿talk to Minorin, so don't sweat it.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡Deja de quejarte! ¡Ve a cambiarte de＿una vez, perro inútil! Yo hablaré con＿Minorin, así que no te preocupes.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Alright, I get it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Está bien, ya entendí!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I said I get it!」"
